help[project-unbounded-session]: SessionContext built without a bounded RuntimeEnv; a large query can exhaust memory.
    ┌─ crates/enrichment-store/tests/typed_arrow.rs:170:15
    │
170 │     let ctx = SessionContext::new();
    │               ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
    │
    = SessionContext::new and new_with_config take the default RuntimeEnv, which has no memory
      limit and no spill path: an aggregation or sort larger than RAM aborts the process rather than
      spilling. RuntimeEnvBuilder supplies with_memory_pool, with_temp_file_path and
      with_max_temp_directory_size; pass the result to SessionContext::new_with_config_rt.
      See content/api/datafusion_execution.runtime_env.md#runtimeenvbuilder.

